    "description": "the STK2 bomb shelter (2011-12 scenario a03_bomb_shelter: its octagonal store room with its shelves, crates and beds, and the vaults beside it) as a 0.26g lobby project, projects/lobby_scene/stk2_bunker, lit by STK2's own lights, sun and post-process; the character's spot 0.25 m clear of the crates and the leaf pile beside it left out (the squad's left member stood in it), camera boxes over the floor and around the props the lobby camera got into, the weapon 0.40 m above the metal boxes; @3: relit warm (the owner's pick): a box probe of the room from a warm-neutral gradient, STK2's three wide fills shortened and warmed short of orange, a warm light under each street lamp (the one behind the character shadowed, the character lit all the way round), the lamps' shades glowing (STK2's unlit lamp_street given its emissive variant, emitting its texture), a camera box across the front arch to the next vault; @4: the whole shelter (the slice's box grown to x 24..63, z -36..6: its corridors, vaults and rooms beyond the store room's doorways, which showed the sky through the cut), their lamps as warm; a dim warm light in each vault beyond the room's arches (they showed black)"
